# Plan Execution — Mr. Brij Astro Site

When building from `.cursor/plans/mr_brij_astro_site_e42034d2.plan.md` or `docs/PLAN.md`:

## Before Starting Any Plan Todo

1. Read `mr-brij-orchestrator` skill: `.cursor/skills/mr-brij-orchestrator/SKILL.md`
2. Read the matching phase skill (table below)
3. Delegate to the subagent via Task tool when the phase is substantial
4. Log completion to `.cursor/skills/_learnings/skill-usage-log.json`

## Plan Todo → Skill → Subagent

| Plan todo id | Skill | Subagent |
|--------------|-------|----------|
| `scaffold` | `astro-personal-site` | `astro-site-builder` |
| `layouts-design` | `astro-personal-site` + `mr-brij-brand-guide` | `astro-site-builder` |
| `core-pages` | `astro-personal-site` + `mr-brij-brand-guide` | `astro-site-builder` |
| `migrate-posts` | `jekyll-to-astro-migration` | `blog-migrator` |
| `seo-rss` | `github-pages-deploy` | `seo-deploy-agent` |
| `deploy` | `github-pages-deploy` | `seo-deploy-agent` |
| `polish-launch` | `github-pages-deploy` + `mr-brij-brand-guide` | `seo-deploy-agent` + `brand-alignment-reviewer` |

## Execution Order

```
scaffold → layouts-design → core-pages → migrate-posts → seo-rss → deploy → polish-launch
```

`migrate-posts` may start after `scaffold` completes (needs `src/content/`).

## Kickoff Prompt (copy when starting build)

```
Execute @.cursor/plans/mr_brij_astro_site_e42034d2.plan.md phase by phase.
Follow @.cursor/rules/plan-execution.mdc — read workspace skills and delegate
to subagents per the routing table. Start with todo: scaffold.
```

## Verification Per Todo

- Run skill's verification steps (usually `npm run build`)
- Mark plan todo complete only after verification passes
- Run `brand-alignment-reviewer` before `polish-launch` sign-off
